sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Authenticated Client (JWT)
    participant Filter as TenantContextFilter
    participant Thread as ThreadLocal (TenantContext)
    participant AOP as TenantTransactionInterceptor
    participant Pool as HikariCP Connection Pool
    participant PG as PostgreSQL 16 Kernel (app_user)

    Client->>Filter: HTTP Request (Authorization: Bearer <JWT>, X-Tenant-Id: tenant-alpha)
    Note over Filter: Validates token claims & extracts tenantId
    Filter->>Thread: TenantContext.setTenantId("tenant-alpha")
    Filter->>Thread: MDC.put("tenant_id", "tenant-alpha")

    Filter->>AOP: Invoke @Transactional Service Method
    AOP->>Thread: TenantContext.getTenantId()
    AOP->>Pool: Borrow physical Connection
    AOP->>PG: EXECUTE: SELECT set_config('app.tenant_id', 'tenant-alpha', true)
    Note over PG: Transaction-local session variable bound.<br/>Auto-resets on COMMIT/ROLLBACK.

    AOP->>PG: Hibernate Query: SELECT * FROM tickets WHERE id = ?
    Note over PG: Kernel applies RLS Policy:<br/>USING (tenant_id = current_setting('app.tenant_id', true))
    PG-->>AOP: Return only rows matching tenant-alpha
    AOP-->>Filter: Method Return / Transaction Commit

    Note over Filter: finally block cleans up ThreadLocal
    Filter->>Thread: TenantContext.clear()
    Filter->>Thread: MDC.remove("tenant_id")
    Filter-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK (Isolated Payload)
